synonym: "whole-cell biocatalyst" EXACT [DOI: 10.1186/s12934-017-0724-7]
is_a: BFO:0000040 ! material entity
is_a: CL:0000000 ! cell

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000013
name: taxon quality
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A quality of one or more biological organisms, as well as of parts of organism pertaining to a biological taxon." [PMID:18586729]
synonym: "taxon" BROAD [NCBITaxon:1]
xref: http://purl.org/biotop/btl2.owl#TaxonQuality
is_a: BFO:0000019 ! quality

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000014
name: bioreactor
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A device or system that is a material entity designed to support the run of a biological and biochemical process by controlling regulated environmental and cultivation conditions, such as temperature, agitation or nutrient injection at different scales, including lab-scale, pilot plant, and industrial-scale systems." [OBI:0001046]
comment: While this term is equivalent to OBI:0001046, PREFER has specific modelling that makes it more difficult to maintain if used directly. A decision was hence made to create this new term in PREFER and map it to OBI:0001046 instead.
synonym: "bioreactor system" EXACT []
synonym: "fermenter" NARROW [MSIO:0000167]
xref: OBI:0001046
is_a: BFO:0000040 ! material entity
relationship: PREFER:8000008 PREFER:0000185 ! has bioreactor scale bioreactor scale
relationship: PREFER:8000018 PREFER:0000180 ! has operational mode operation mode control variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000015
name: operational parameter
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "An information content entity that represents a set of configurable settings used to operate and control a fermentation process, grouping process control variables and mode dependent parameters that define how cultivation conditions are regulated in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
comment: Operational parameters may vary depending on the selected fermentation operational mode (e.g. batch, fed-batch, continuous) and are realized through instrument or system configuration.
synonym: "operational setting" BROAD []
synonym: "parameter" BROAD [NCIT:C44175]
xref: REPR:InstrumentSetting
is_a: IAO:0000030 ! information content entity

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000016
name: fermentation phase
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A time interval of a fermentation process." []
is_a: PREFER:9000003 ! precision fermentation process
relationship: BFO:0000050 PREFER:0000004 ! part of fermentation run

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000017
name: phase event
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "An operational intervention set by user that triggers the start or end of the fermentation phase." []
is_a: PREFER:9000003 ! precision fermentation process

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000018
name: offline sample
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A material entity consisting of a sample that has been withdrawn from a bioprocess system or bioreactor at a specific time point during the ongoing fermentation run for subsequent offline analysis of various compounds, such as substrates, products, and by-products, and biomass." []
synonym: "collected sample" EXACT []
synonym: "material sample" BROAD [OBI:0000747]
is_a: BFO:0000040 ! material entity

