[Term]
id: PREFER:0000034
name: starting optical density measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the initial optical density (OD) of the fermentation culture from a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
comment: The starting OD measurement is either measured (by taking a sample after inoculation and measuring the cell density spectophotometrically at 600nm or 900nm wavelength) or  calculated (by knowing the final OD of the seed culture, volume inoculated and final cultivation volume).
synonym: "precision fermentation process starting optical density measurement variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting OD measurement variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
