def: "A unit representing a mol-based ratio, typically used to express product, output substance or input - such as compound and substrate -  in moles per mole of substrate(S) consumed (mol/mol)." []
synonym: "mol/mol" EXACT [NCIT]
synonym: "Mole per Mole" EXACT [NCIT]
synonym: "Mole/Mole" EXACT [NCIT]
is_a: PREFER:9000004 ! unit

